{"review_id": "1e1a32f4-b43e-406b-a518-0f58ae30192e", "package": "planner.task.todolist.habit", "app_name": "iTask - To Do List & Planner", "language": "ig", "language_name": "ig", "rating": 5, "text": "Great app! I'm always on the lookout for an app that is complex enough to work with my neurodivergent brain, but yet, intuitive enough to stay engaged with. My only minute gripe, is that I don't want or need the discovery page... Or maybe I don't understand it? So maybe having an off/on toggle for that category could be a feature? I personally feel distracted by it taking up space on the main page. Otherwise, it's layout is really nice!!!", "author": "Burgundy Black", "date": "2024-05-25T01:34:48Z", "thumbs_up": 8, "app_version": "1.0.1", "developer_reply": "Thanks for your feedback, we will seriously consider your suggestions!"}
{"review_id": "6884bb5c-46c6-40cf-99db-a45a145f5c61", "package": "planner.task.todolist.habit", "app_name": "iTask - To Do List & Planner", "language": "ig", "language_name": "ig", "rating": 5, "text": "As an autistic person, routines are very important to me, and this app is perfect for keeping track of what I have done and what I need to do. Its easy to use and very helpful!!!", "author": "Violet Robinson", "date": "2024-05-24T19:53:03Z", "thumbs_up": 4, "app_version": "1.0.1", "developer_reply": "Thanks for your support!"}
